OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry start with the odd bright
OL,6,Fspell north but cloud and rain in the
OL,7,Fsouth will soon spread north. This
OL,8,Frain will begin to clear from the west
OL,9,Ffrom the late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with rain in the east
OL,12,Fat first but dry in the west. The rain
OL,13,Fwill clear east by the late evening,
OL,14,Fleaving increasing clear spells.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FCloudy but dry at first.
OL,17,FOutbreaks of rain, heavy at times,
OL,18,Fsoon spread east. The wind will
OL,19,Fstrengthen from the morning, reaching
OL,20,Fgale to severe gale later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
